      "content": "\"let go of the fight\"? that's what you're saying? that there's no point in even trying to rebuild or find something else? because honestly, everything i've tried to do to find peace just leads me back to the same despair. it's like there's no version of life where this doesn't just keep happening. what does \"letting go\" even look like when you've already lost everything?",
